id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8c5bcde47c6395b\" href=\"?note=a8c5bcde47c6395b\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter\">58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}:V\\to V\\)</span> (restricted inclusion relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}subset\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}subset\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\exists N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(N,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\n(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X))\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\n\\land N\\subseteq\\mathcal F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\exists N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(N,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\n(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X))\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\n\\land N\\subseteq\\mathcal F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The inclusion order is a set relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, not the proper-class relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> passed as though it were a set argument.</li>\n<li>Topology and point membership are explicit guards.  Excluding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> rules out the improper filter, which otherwise converges to every point under the generic poset-filter definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter","status":"resolved","id":"a8c5bcde47c6395b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator","status":"resolved","id":"99a7a09e1b39c781","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-power-set-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter","status":"resolved","id":"a8c5bcde47c6395b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-top-neighborhood-filter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-filter]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}subset\\text{-}order}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)^2:A\\subseteq B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop2FilterConvergence}_S(\\mathcal F,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land x\\in X\n\\land\\exists N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopNeighborhoodFilter}_S(N,x,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S\n(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\operatorname{SubsetOrder}(X))\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\n\\land N\\subseteq\\mathcal F\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2029,"backlinks":[{"id":"84da